ians says “come out from among them and be separate”; Jeremiah says “Come out of her, My people!”"},{"id":"q644","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":6,"v":17},"b":{"book":"ezekiel","c":20,"v":34},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians says “come out from among them”; Ezekiel says “I will bring you out from the peoples.”"},{"id":"q648","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"ezekiel","c":37,"v":27},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians repeats Ezekiel’s promise “I will be their God, and they will be My people.”"},{"id":"q761","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"exodus","c":29,"v":45},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians says God will “dwell with them” and “be their God”; Exodus says He will “dwell among the Israelites and be their God.”"},{"id":"q762","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"jeremiah","c":30,"v":22},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians says “I will be their God”; Jeremiah says “you will be My people, and I will be your God.”"},{"id":"q763","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"jeremiah","c":31,"v":1},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians repeats Jeremiah’s words “they will be My people,” where the LORD says He will be “the God of all the families of Israel.”"},{"id":"q764","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-corinthians","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"jeremiah","c":32,"v":38},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"2 Corinthians repeats Jeremiah’s words “will be My people” and “I will be their God.”"},{"id":"q765","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"2-